c_oc=AdrZqMUNEaM-Wz88zVHXVbBT5uKWQt_5yt3_GXuRQfY0a7HY6RLVFp-ZBPIUJV_cwEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrq9sOlnms-2-_8PqF8cRa3pg1kZ41TOZPPpjSucQ7wA&oe=6AEB34BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SEGi Universe", "keywords": ["SEGiUniversity", "VirtualLearning", "SEGiUniverse", "VirtualUniversity", "VrCampus"], "long_description": "SEGi Universe is an immersive virtual campus experience created for SEGi University students. Step into a digital version of the university where you can explore campus environments, interact with fellow students, and participate in university activities in virtual reality.\n\nConnect with friends through real-time voice communication, discover campus spaces, and join live sessions, events, and community gatherings from anywhere. SEGi Universe brings learning, collaboration, and social interaction together in a shared virtual world designed to enhance the student experience.\n\nFeatures\n\ud83c\udfeb Explore a virtual SEGi University campus\n\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Meet and interact with fellow students\n\ud83c\udfa4 Real-time voice communication\n\ud83c\udf93 Attend live sessions and university events\n\ud83c\udf10 Social and collaborative virtual environment\n\ud83d\ude80 Continuous updates and new features planned\n\nSEGi Universe is designed to create a connected, engaging, and innovative digital campus experience, helping students learn, socialize, and collaborate beyond the boundaries of the physical campus.\n\nVersion 1.0 \u2013 Initial Release. More locations, activities, customization options, and student-focused experiences will be added in future updates.", "short_description": "Meet friends, explore campus, and join live sessions in the SEGi Universe."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://segiuniverse.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GTDD Departmen