9LDFAlMMWbViUMctuxV30r6jh2KS8FpfFGnZWVbJ5TRDlsC218&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_Rf_kJUPT4JKOC_z3xbWuThPlti162bsTL6z7Uyui8g&oe=6AEB47A6"}, {"file_name": "Theater.png", "id": "1704955430455348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1704955433788681_6364941822553845998_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MebPdtZYFzgQ7kNvwGsD7-G&_nc_oc=AdrZqMUNEaM-Wz88zVHXVbBT5uKWQt_5yt3_GXuRQfY0a7HY6RLVFp-ZBPIUJV_cwEE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrq9sOlnms-2-_8PqF8cRa3pg1kZ41TOZPPpjSucQ7wA&oe=6AEB34BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SEGi Universe", "keywords": ["SEGiUniversity", "VirtualLearning", "SEGiUniverse", "VirtualUniversity", "VrCampus"], "long_description": "SEGi Universe is an immersive virtual campus experience created for SEGi University students. Step into a digital version of the university where you can explore campus environments, interact with fellow students, and participate in university activities in virtual reality.\n\nConnect with friends through real-time voice communication, discover campus spaces, and join live sessions, events, and community gatherings from anywhere. SEGi Universe brings learning, collaboration, and social interaction together in a shared virtual world designed to enhance the student experience.\n\nFeatures\n\ud83c\udfeb Explore a virtual SEGi University campus\n\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Meet and interact with fellow students\n\ud83c\udfa4 Real-time voice communication\n\ud83c\udf93 Attend live sessions and university events\n\ud83c\udf10 Social and collaborative virtual environment\n\ud83d\ude80 Continuous updates and new features planned\n\nSEGi Universe is designed to create a connected, engaging, and innovative digital campus experience, helping students learn, socialize, and collaborate beyond the boundaries of the physical campus.\n\nVersion 1.0 \u2013 Initial Release. More locations, activities, customization options, and student-focused experiences will be added in future updates.", "short_description": "Meet friends, explore campus, and join live sessions in the SEGi Universe."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://segiuniverse.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GTDD Department", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.segi.edu.my/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1132943536578280"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1949166526469901"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1949166526469901"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785459420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1949166526469901"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1316289268243705", "version": "12.0.0"}, "id": "1475446243907602", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1316289268243705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792117084, "id": "1316289268243705", "version": "12.0.0", "version_code": 12, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1316288688243763"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1316289268243705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": "SEGi Universe \u2013 Release Notes (v11.0)\r\n\r\nWe are excited to introduce the latest update to SEGi Universe, bringing an even more immersive and engaging virtual campus experience for SEGi University students. In this version, students can now explore additional areas of the campus, including the Library, Front Exterior Walkway, Back Exterior Walkway, and fully accessible Classrooms, creating a more realistic and interactive digital university environment. The update also introduces Live Podcast Sessions and Live Lecture Sessions for signed-in users, allowing students to participate in educational content, discussions, and events directly within the virtual world. To enhance the overall experience, all 3D models have been fully optimized for improved performance, smoother navigation, and better visual quality across supported devices. Additionally, networking and voice communication have been further refined to provide a more stable multiplayer experience, reduced latency, improved avatar responsiveness, and greater overall system stability. With these improvements, SEGi Universe continues to evolve as a social and educational metaverse where students can explore, learn, connect, and collaborate in a shared virtual campus.", "created_date": 1790233924, "id": "1271380006067965", "version": "11.0.0", "version_code": 11, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1271379532734679"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1316289268243705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": "SEGi Universe \u2013 Release Notes (v10.0)\r\n\r\nWe are excited to introduce the latest update to SEGi Universe, bringing an even more immersive and engaging virtual campus experience for SEGi University students. In this version, students can now explore additional areas of the campus, including the Library, Front Exterior Walkway, Back Exterior Walkway, and fully accessible Classrooms, creating a more realistic and interactive digital university environment. The update also introduces Live Podcast Sessions and Live Lecture Sessions for signed-in users, allowing students to participate in educational content, discussions, and events directly within the virtual world. To enhance the overall experience, all 3D models have been fully optimized for improved performance, smoother navigation, and better visual quality across supported devices. Additionally, networking and voice communication have been further refined to provide a more stable multiplayer experience, reduced latency, improved avatar responsiveness, and greater overall system stability. With these improvements, SEGi Universe continues to evolve as a social and educational metaverse where students can explore, learn, connect, and collaborate in a shared virtual campus.", "created_date": 1790231581, "id": "1271343099404989", "version": "10.0.0", "version_code": 10, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1271336242739008"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1316289268243705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": "SEGi Universe \u2013 Release Notes (v9.0) We\u2019re excited to launch the first version of SEGi Universe, a metaverse experience designed exclusively for SEGi University students. \ufffd What\u2019s New in Version 9.0 \ufffd Explore SEGi Campus in Virtual Reality Step into a digital version of SEGi University and freely roam around the campus environment in an immersive 3D space. \ufffd Meet & Talk with Friends Connect with classmates and friends in real-time voice chat. Hang out, interact, and build a social experience just like in real life. \ufffd Attend Live Sessions Together Join live lectures, events, and group sessions with friends inside the virtual world. Experience learning in a more interactive and engaging way. \ufffd Social Metaverse Experience A shared virtual space where students can gather, explore, and collaborate in a new digital campus environment. \ufffd Performance & Stability Improved avatar movement responsiveness Optimized networking for smoother multiplayer interaction Reduced latency in voice communication", "created_date": 1785231283, "id": "1174887905717176", "version": "9.0.0", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1174887505717216"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1316289268243705"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": "SEGi Universe \u2013 Release Notes (v8.0)\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re excited to launch the first version of SEGi Universe, a metaverse experience designed exclusively for SEGi University students.\r\n\r\n\ufffd What\u2019s New in Version 8.0\r\n\r\n\ufffd Explore SEGi Campus in Virtual Reality\r\nStep into a digital version of SEGi University and freely roam around the campus environment in an immersive 3D space.\r\n\r\n\ufffd Meet & Talk with Friends\r\nConnect with classmates and friends in real-time voice chat. Hang out, interact, and build a social experience just like in real life.\r\n\r\n\ufffd Attend Live Sessions Together\r\nJoin live lectures, events, and group sessions with friends inside the virtual world. Experience learning in a more interactive and engaging way.\r\n\r\n\ufffd Social Metaverse Experience\r\nA shared virtual space where students can gather, explore, and collaborate in a new digital campus environment.\r\n\r\n\ufffd Performance & Stability\r\nImproved avatar movement responsiveness\r\nOptimized networking for smoother multiplayer interaction\r\nReduced latency in voice communication", "created_date": 1784100465, "id": "1155752340964066", "version": "8.0.0", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1155751444297489"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBi